  // The second basement of the passage under Goldenrod City (plan 20 · J11, part b): HeartGold's floor, our words.
  // Team Rocket hold it while the takeover is at its height; ten shutters cut its corridors and three switches turn
  // them over, and the red-haired boy comes down after the player (scripts/goldenrod_tunnel_b2f.txt). Each shutter is
  // a row of things of the map over the tiles HeartGold's sliding gates close, shown while its flag of ours says it is
  // shut; the red-haired boy is a person of our own, since HeartGold keeps him beyond the floor until his scene
  "area": "goldenrod_tunnel_b2f",
